      "content": "Surrender? To them? They'll make an example of me. They'll put me in chains and parade me through the streets of the capital while they laugh at everything I've ever stood for. There is no dignity in that, only humiliation. There has to be a way to keep my soul intact, even if it means I don't walk out of this valley.",
